%%{init: {'theme': 'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CCCD as CCCD
    participant LoginRoute as LoginRoute
    participant Entra as SiLAS / Entra
    participant Session as Session

    User->>CCCD: Submit email on sign-in page
    CCCD->>LoginRoute: Resolve login method for email
    alt Login method is Entra
        LoginRoute-->>User: Redirect to Entra authorization
        User->>Entra: Authenticate
        Entra-->>CCCD: OmniAuth callback with email and claims
        CCCD->>CCCD: Verify callback email matches entered email
        alt Email mismatch or no valid account
            CCCD-->>User: Redirect to sign-in with authentication error
        else Account resolved
            CCCD->>CCCD: Update mapped roles where applicable
            CCCD->>CCCD: Load primary plus active, enabled direct linked users
            alt Multi-firm enabled and more than one selectable account
                CCCD->>Session: Store primary user ID
                CCCD-->>User: Show account chooser before signing in
                User->>CCCD: Select account ID
                CCCD->>CCCD: Re-check selected ID belongs to selectable account list
                alt Selection is valid
                    CCCD->>Session: Sign in selected CCCD User
                    CCCD-->>User: Redirect to selected account dashboard
                    Note over User,CCCD: Header shows Switch account while primary ID remains in session
                    User->>CCCD: Choose Switch account
                    CCCD-->>User: Re-open account chooser
                    User->>CCCD: Select another account in the same direct link group
                    CCCD->>CCCD: Re-check membership and account status
                    CCCD->>Session: Sign in selected CCCD User
                    CCCD-->>User: Redirect to selected account dashboard
                else Selection is invalid or session is stale
                    CCCD->>Session: Clear primary user ID
                    CCCD-->>User: Redirect to sign-in
                end
            else One selectable account or multi-firm disabled
                CCCD->>Session: Clear stale primary user ID and sign in resolved User
                CCCD-->>User: Redirect to resolved account dashboard
            end
        end
    else Login method is legacy
        LoginRoute-->>User: Redirect to legacy password sign-in
        User->>CCCD: Submit email and password
        CCCD->>CCCD: Authenticate through Devise
        CCCD-->>User: Sign in directly to primary CCCD account
        Note over User,CCCD: Current legacy flow does not invoke the multi-firm chooser
    end
